WEBVTT

00:00:21.822 --> 00:00:25.425
Amazing. The asteroid was
blown away with just one blast.

00:00:25.425 --> 00:00:30.463
That is the force of the Girouard
Force's new Type-X warhead.

00:00:30.463 --> 00:00:34.100
Hmm. Not even Thanatos should
be able to withstand one of those.

00:00:34.100 --> 00:00:37.204
Yes. If only the new model of
shuttle that can take the Type-X

00:00:37.204 --> 00:00:41.541
as payload and launch a direct attack
against Thanatos were complete,

00:00:41.541 --> 00:00:44.044
D Project could be realized.

00:00:44.044 --> 00:00:48.815
So, how is that crucial
new-model shuttle coming along?

00:00:48.815 --> 00:00:52.452
The shuttle's development
is not part of our contract.

00:00:52.452 --> 00:00:55.216
That is under ISDA's control.

00:00:59.492 --> 00:01:03.330
We have failed to develop the new shuttle.

00:01:03.330 --> 00:01:04.364
What?!

00:01:04.364 --> 00:01:07.167
Are you saying that while
the Type-X is completed,

00:01:07.167 --> 00:01:09.658
we have no means to use it?!

00:01:12.706 --> 00:01:14.074
We have a means.

00:01:14.074 --> 00:01:17.143
That's ridiculous! How long
do you think it will take

00:01:17.143 --> 00:01:19.813
to reach the orbit of Pluto
using existing shuttles?!

00:01:19.813 --> 00:01:23.483
Using Dragons,
sublight-speed flight is possible.

00:01:23.483 --> 00:01:26.419
- What?
- D-Dragons?!

00:01:26.419 --> 00:01:30.223
A direct attack against Thanatos,
using earthborn Dragons.

00:01:30.223 --> 00:01:32.859
That is D Project.

00:01:48.074 --> 00:01:53.780
In my younger days, I lost

00:01:53.780 --> 00:01:59.686
even the reason for this pain

00:01:59.686 --> 00:02:05.392
Crouching over, making excuses

00:02:05.392 --> 00:02:08.589
I must have...

00:02:10.030 --> 00:02:16.303
Taking hold of the premonition
I saw at the end of the blue,

00:02:16.303 --> 00:02:23.910
riding the wind, I'm off
to where the light shines

00:02:23.910 --> 00:02:26.746
I'll always be with you

00:02:26.746 --> 00:02:29.249
see the sky in front of you

00:02:29.249 --> 00:02:33.618
fly high in a light from the deepest blue

00:02:35.422 --> 00:02:40.961
Riding the echo of swirling stars,

00:02:40.961 --> 00:02:43.630
I sing out

00:02:43.630 --> 00:02:52.299
May my voice reach you

00:03:10.523 --> 00:03:14.152
Toa, where are you? Where did you go?

00:03:18.031 --> 00:03:20.625
Toa!!

00:03:28.508 --> 00:03:32.345
The Ostrum and Atrum are
engaged in combat over the base!

00:03:32.345 --> 00:03:35.715
Can we still not reach Lindworm Unit?

00:03:35.715 --> 00:03:38.843
No, communications are not yet restored!

00:03:48.061 --> 00:03:50.859
Can you get up, Howling Star?

00:03:52.499 --> 00:03:55.400
Machina, wake up! Are you all right?

00:04:16.656 --> 00:04:20.560
Who is that guy? We had our
hands full with just the Ostrum!

00:04:20.560 --> 00:04:23.329
That is the Atrum.

00:04:23.329 --> 00:04:26.533
The third Original, one I've
been seeking for a long time.

00:04:26.533 --> 00:04:29.069
T-That's the Atrum?

00:04:29.069 --> 00:04:34.007
Then, the third and fourth
Originals are fighting each other?

00:04:34.007 --> 00:04:36.908
But why are they over the base?

00:04:38.611 --> 00:04:42.206
That... the Atrum...

00:04:44.617 --> 00:04:46.608
...is Professor Nozaki.

00:04:50.557 --> 00:04:54.186
The Atrum... is Professor Nozaki?!

00:05:11.644 --> 00:05:15.482
I know the reason why
Thanatos sent you here.

00:05:15.482 --> 00:05:22.055
Thanatos? Ah, so that's what the
people of this planet call Mother.

00:05:22.055 --> 00:05:25.925
To exterminate the Dragons that were
born on this world. Isn't that right?

00:05:25.925 --> 00:05:29.662
You've become too involved
with the creatures of this world.

00:05:29.662 --> 00:05:32.599
Mother does not wish there to be Dragons

00:05:32.599 --> 00:05:34.634
that were raised by man's hand.

00:05:34.634 --> 00:05:38.805
I won't let you lay a finger on my children!

00:05:38.805 --> 00:05:42.742
Don't you understand? To defy me...

00:05:42.742 --> 00:05:45.404
...is the same as defying Mother!

00:05:49.415 --> 00:05:52.318
You've changed,
after encountering humans.

00:05:52.318 --> 00:05:55.655
If you went through Resonance,
you'd come to understand!

00:05:55.655 --> 00:05:57.680
I will not change!

00:06:17.143 --> 00:06:20.013
Jin...

00:06:20.013 --> 00:06:24.006
I am only able to exist because of you.

00:06:30.690 --> 00:06:35.028
That's why I always want
to remain in this form.

00:06:35.028 --> 00:06:38.122
I never want to go back
to my original form again.

00:06:58.251 --> 00:07:01.387
Your Highness, the Neo-Original
sent from Thanatos

00:07:01.387 --> 00:07:04.390
appears to have destroyed
Shin-Ogasawara Terminal City,

00:07:04.390 --> 00:07:08.156
and laid waste to ISDA's Dragonaut base.

00:07:12.498 --> 00:07:18.605
Did you hear that? It sounds like
your pal is running wild on Earth.

00:07:18.605 --> 00:07:20.937
I have to do something, quickly.

00:07:27.747 --> 00:07:31.017
I will show you my true form.

00:07:31.017 --> 00:07:32.885
So please, turn off that unpleasant sound.

00:07:32.885 --> 00:07:37.257
I see. That was rather careless of me.

00:07:37.257 --> 00:07:42.528
With the CSS in operation,
you couldn't have Actualized.

00:07:42.528 --> 00:07:47.467
But, if I do that, then you
will flee from before me.

00:07:47.467 --> 00:07:50.903
I won't run away. I promise.

00:07:50.903 --> 00:07:54.532
Then, ask me nicely.

00:07:59.812 --> 00:08:03.049
Please, terminate the CSS.

00:08:03.049 --> 00:08:06.653
I don't think I heard you correctly.

00:08:06.653 --> 00:08:09.422
I... beg you...

00:08:09.422 --> 00:08:11.253
Who?

00:08:17.397 --> 00:08:24.103
I beg you, Asim-sama!
Please, terminate the CSS!

00:08:24.103 --> 00:08:25.972
No.

00:08:25.972 --> 00:08:30.677
With that rebellious look in
your eye, you still are not mine.

00:08:30.677 --> 00:08:34.614
But we had an agreement!

00:08:34.614 --> 00:08:39.652
Once you become mine,
I'll do as you ask anytime.

00:08:39.652 --> 00:08:42.855
Please! Let me out of here!

00:08:42.855 --> 00:08:45.483
Please! Let me out!

00:08:57.303 --> 00:08:59.305
Jin...

00:08:59.305 --> 00:09:03.042
I'm... in here...

00:09:03.042 --> 00:09:06.808
Toa, where in the world are you?

00:09:21.894 --> 00:09:23.828
Professor Nozaki...

00:09:45.151 --> 00:09:46.982
Kitajima-kun!

00:09:51.557 --> 00:09:53.726
Professor Nozaki!

00:09:53.726 --> 00:09:56.490
You just lie there, nice and quiet.

00:09:58.197 --> 00:10:00.825
There's still one left, is there?

00:10:28.728 --> 00:10:31.597
This is no time for us to be
standing around down here!

00:10:31.597 --> 00:10:35.268
Let's show him our true power!

00:10:35.268 --> 00:10:37.069
Right you are.

00:10:37.069 --> 00:10:40.306
We can still fight.

00:10:40.306 --> 00:10:42.742
Don't go running the
whole show all the time.

00:10:42.742 --> 00:10:46.145
All right, let's go, guys!

00:10:46.145 --> 00:10:48.114
Actualize!

00:10:48.114 --> 00:10:51.743
Incarnate!!

00:11:14.106 --> 00:11:16.802
Howling Star, take off!

00:11:35.595 --> 00:11:37.927
Let's go, Machina!

00:12:08.528 --> 00:12:10.291
Amadeus!

00:12:32.585 --> 00:12:34.348
Amadeus!

00:12:38.257 --> 00:12:40.418
Little man!

00:12:45.665 --> 00:12:49.502
Mister Cyril! Please take refuge
in the underground shelter at once!

00:12:49.502 --> 00:12:52.405
Hey! What is the Girouard Force doing?!

00:12:52.405 --> 00:12:56.842
Their contract with ISDA is still in effect!

00:12:56.842 --> 00:12:59.378
We need to have your protection!

00:12:59.378 --> 00:13:02.081
No, this isn't about any contract issue!

00:13:02.081 --> 00:13:04.584
The whole Earth is in danger!

00:13:04.584 --> 00:13:07.186
ISDA is requesting backup?

00:13:07.186 --> 00:13:12.249
Yes, Mister Cyril is requesting
that we dispatch Agathions.

00:13:13.893 --> 00:13:17.063
Hmm. It's hard for me to
just sit here and watch on

00:13:17.063 --> 00:13:19.599
as Dragons destroy Earth.

00:13:19.599 --> 00:13:22.568
Then you'll send the
Agathions, as requested?

00:13:22.568 --> 00:13:29.775
Yeah. But let's wait a little longer,
until ISDA is destroyed.

00:13:29.775 --> 00:13:31.310
What's the matter?

00:13:31.310 --> 00:13:35.281
Oh, it's nothing.

00:13:35.281 --> 00:13:37.374
Senpai...

00:13:40.152 --> 00:13:42.086
Please excuse me.

00:13:53.132 --> 00:13:54.963
You...

00:13:56.636 --> 00:14:02.642
What were you planning to do
once the CSS was shut down?

00:14:02.642 --> 00:14:07.246
My mission was to bring
back the earthborn Dragons.

00:14:07.246 --> 00:14:11.083
But as a result of me not being
able to communicate with Mother,

00:14:11.083 --> 00:14:13.786
it sent a new envoy.

00:14:13.786 --> 00:14:20.259
Mother has abandoned the earthborn
Dragons, along with mankind.

00:14:20.259 --> 00:14:24.096
But there's still time if I act now!
If my voice reaches Mother...

00:14:24.096 --> 00:14:27.166
I don't care what your mission is.

00:14:27.166 --> 00:14:33.339
I just want to know if
you're able to save Earth.

00:14:33.339 --> 00:14:37.543
I don't know. But...

00:14:37.543 --> 00:14:41.847
I want to protect the one I love. That's all.

00:14:41.847 --> 00:14:45.351
The one you love...

00:14:45.351 --> 00:14:47.444
Senpai...

00:14:50.389 --> 00:14:52.823
Save Dr. Kitajima.

00:14:56.562 --> 00:14:58.325
Thanks!

00:15:08.841 --> 00:15:11.143
You were with ISDA for too long,

00:15:11.143 --> 00:15:13.212
and their emotions rubbed off on you.

00:15:13.212 --> 00:15:17.483
No matter. I was planning to
dispose of you before long, anyhow.

00:15:17.483 --> 00:15:20.213
Senpai...

00:15:24.023 --> 00:15:26.321
How could you?

00:15:32.932 --> 00:15:34.593
Toa!

00:15:43.242 --> 00:15:47.213
No doubt about it! It's Toa! It's Toa's song!

00:15:47.213 --> 00:15:48.848
I've found Toa!

00:15:48.848 --> 00:15:51.442
Where? Where is she?

00:16:01.560 --> 00:16:03.289
On Mars!

00:16:14.874 --> 00:16:19.311
Caged bird, you sit here
quietly in your cage.

00:16:23.582 --> 00:16:25.607
The song is gone!

00:16:35.161 --> 00:16:36.128
Akira!

00:16:36.128 --> 00:16:38.831
Jin, let us handle this, and get to Mars!

00:16:38.831 --> 00:16:41.834
But he's not through yet!

00:16:41.834 --> 00:16:46.939
Don't go selling Akira-sama short.
I'm gonna pound that guy but good!

00:16:46.939 --> 00:16:48.908
- Akira...
- You can't.

00:16:48.908 --> 00:16:51.911
I cannot permit you to act on
your own during an operation.

00:16:51.911 --> 00:16:54.180
Or so I'd tell you...

00:16:54.180 --> 00:16:57.983
...but unfortunately, you are
not yet an official Dragonaut.

00:16:57.983 --> 00:16:59.418
Raina-san...

00:16:59.418 --> 00:17:01.620
Why don't you go on?

00:17:01.620 --> 00:17:05.112
We'll do just the same without you around.

00:17:17.303 --> 00:17:18.930
Dummy.

00:17:24.643 --> 00:17:26.474
Oh, no you don't!

00:17:33.686 --> 00:17:36.177
Go on, Kamishina Jin!

00:17:38.057 --> 00:17:39.786
Guys...

00:17:50.369 --> 00:17:52.132
I...

00:17:59.745 --> 00:18:03.249
I... I...

00:18:03.249 --> 00:18:05.551
Lindworm Unit has been wiped out!

00:18:05.551 --> 00:18:07.152
Receiving a message
from the Girouard Force.

00:18:07.152 --> 00:18:10.349
It says that it will take another
hour to deploy their Agathions!

00:18:16.161 --> 00:18:20.427
The Force is planning to stand
by and watch us go down.

00:18:23.269 --> 00:18:26.238
What do we do, Sakaki sir?

00:18:27.873 --> 00:18:30.109
There's still a way!

00:18:30.109 --> 00:18:31.872
Otohime!

00:18:36.248 --> 00:18:38.079
Yuya!

00:18:39.718 --> 00:18:42.421
Otohime is outfitted with a Type-X!

00:18:42.421 --> 00:18:45.624
Are you serious?! If one
of those is used on Earth...

00:18:45.624 --> 00:18:47.192
...all of Asia will be blown away!

00:18:47.192 --> 00:18:48.794
I know!

00:18:48.794 --> 00:18:51.786
I'm going to take him out
into space, and blow us up!

00:19:07.246 --> 00:19:10.875
Otohime is taking the Ostrum
with her and climbing!

00:19:12.318 --> 00:19:15.721
Reading the Type-X's timer
detonation switch activation.

00:19:15.721 --> 00:19:18.281
180 seconds to detonation!

00:19:21.927 --> 00:19:23.656
Yuya...

00:19:36.775 --> 00:19:38.504
It can't be!

00:19:43.816 --> 00:19:46.185
Oh, no! The Type-X...

00:19:46.185 --> 00:19:48.120
The countdown is still
proceeding as before!

00:19:48.120 --> 00:19:50.953
60 seconds to detonation!

00:19:54.994 --> 00:19:57.758
I'm sorry, Yuya.

00:20:08.774 --> 00:20:10.366
Jin!

00:20:13.445 --> 00:20:15.276
Was that?

00:20:16.382 --> 00:20:19.647
I am not alone anymore!

00:20:27.626 --> 00:20:30.162
Gio is pushing the Ostrum upward!

00:20:30.162 --> 00:20:32.898
10 seconds to Type-X detonation!

00:20:32.898 --> 00:20:35.901
8... 7... 6...

00:20:35.901 --> 00:20:38.037
5... 4...

00:20:38.037 --> 00:20:40.005
3... 2...

00:20:40.005 --> 00:20:42.371
1... 0...

00:21:18.077 --> 00:21:20.773
It's Jin! And Gio, too!

00:21:23.515 --> 00:21:26.279
Those guys did it!

00:21:30.522 --> 00:21:33.225
- Gio...
- Don't speak to me.

00:21:33.225 --> 00:21:35.557
It's too hard to talk.

00:21:39.364 --> 00:21:42.267
The Ostrum has disappeared from the radar!

00:21:42.267 --> 00:21:44.136
Hooray!

00:21:44.136 --> 00:21:48.874
Whew... that sure was nerve-racking.

00:21:48.874 --> 00:21:52.811
As of this moment, D Project
moves to the next phase!

00:21:52.811 --> 00:21:55.414
Get the Avenir ready to launch!

00:21:55.414 --> 00:21:57.041
Roger!

00:22:07.459 --> 00:22:14.133
The moment our eyes met,

00:22:14.133 --> 00:22:20.939
I felt like the sadness was beginning

00:22:20.939 --> 00:22:27.613
The memories that can't be blotted out

00:22:27.613 --> 00:22:34.815
bind our hearts together, even now

00:22:36.655 --> 00:22:43.495
Though there are as many people

00:22:43.495 --> 00:22:46.498
as there are in these thousands of stars,

00:22:46.498 --> 00:22:50.369
you're the only one that I can see

00:22:50.369 --> 00:22:53.539
Though we may not be able to meet,

00:22:53.539 --> 00:22:56.475
and our wishes might not be granted,

00:22:56.475 --> 00:23:02.781
our growing feelings
are sure to last forever

00:23:02.781 --> 00:23:09.788
If fate tears the two of us apart,

00:23:09.788 --> 00:23:16.628
I believe that just meeting
each other was a miracle

00:23:16.628 --> 00:23:23.202
Look how it flows, like this rain

00:23:23.202 --> 00:23:29.241
I want to let all of my affection fall on you

00:23:29.241 --> 00:23:33.473
Rain of Love

00:23:42.387 --> 00:23:44.590
"Dragonaut Message Corner!"

00:23:44.590 --> 00:23:47.693
In this segment, we're going to
read messages from all of you!

00:23:47.693 --> 00:23:50.229
Now for our first message.
This comes to us from penname

00:23:50.229 --> 00:23:52.331
"Widow is my wife."

00:23:52.331 --> 00:23:55.000
"I enjoy watching Dragonaut every week.

00:23:55.000 --> 00:23:56.668
The final episode was entertaining.

00:23:56.668 --> 00:23:59.071
I can't help but feel bad that
I won't get to watch it anymore."

00:23:59.071 --> 00:24:01.873
- It's not at all over yet.
- It's on next week, after all!

00:24:01.873 --> 00:24:04.610
Well, it looks like time is up.
Next time, get this!

00:24:04.610 --> 00:24:06.678
We finally get to go into space!

00:24:06.678 --> 00:24:09.579
- See you next week!
- Thanks for your support!
